{"id":"n64509-2-12","stage":0,"title":"넣다 · 放入","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64509-2-12-1","ko":"커피에 설탕은 얼마나 넣을까요?","zh":"咖啡要加多少糖呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피에","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；에：这里表示添加的对象，即“往咖啡里”。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피에","audio":"/audio/66de329602f384b639f6.mp3"}},{"text":"설탕은","meaning":"糖，砂糖","explanation":"설탕：糖，砂糖；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"설탕","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62507","senseId":"1","lemma":"설탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설탕은","audio":"/audio/73343c9bee07d5c827fc.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"넣을까요?","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣을까요","audio":"/audio/f3b4034bd7bf5c229583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7921a3bb40fa91bb","term":"설탕","zh":"糖，砂糖","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3","entryId":"62507","definition":"一种易溶于水的白色粉末，用于增加食物的甜味。","pronunciation":["설탕"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"询问数量或程度；这里问要加多少糖。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/22372bb36a8350158e65.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64509-2-12-2","ko":"두 숟가락만 넣어 주세요.","zh":"请只加两勺就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"숟가락만","meaning":"勺（计量单位）","explanation":"숟가락：这里是计量单位“勺”；만：只、仅，合起来表示“只要两勺”。","readings":[{"term":"숟가락","audio":"/audio/de5bf362af500903e570.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65154","senseId":"2","lemma":"숟가락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숟가락만","audio":"/audio/a9eab04d86bb120f774e.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어","audio":"/audio/5917140fe7e2cfbda3f8.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"de5bf362af500903","term":"숟가락","zh":"勺（计量单位）","audio":"/audio/de5bf362af500903e570.mp3","entryId":"65154","definition":"用汤匙舀取食物时计量其分量的单位。","pronunciation":["숟까락"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b6d82b2a5eea3fef641d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64509","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":12,"sequenceScore":0.354,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["咖啡要加多少糖呢？","咖啡要加多少牛奶呢？","咖啡要冲几杯呢？"],"answer":0,"explanation":"설탕은 얼마나 넣을까요 问加多少糖；설탕 不是牛奶。"},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请只加一勺就好。","请只加两勺就好。","请至少加两勺。"],"answer":1,"explanation":"두 숟가락 是两勺，-만 表示只要，不是至少。"}]}
